//==
// # Assembly witnesses (complexity sweep, chunk M1)
//
// A model with its edges discretized and every face meshed once, before numbering and assembly:
// what the numbering and assembly laws of chunk M1 read. The law runner builds each
// Witness_*Assembly value once per sweep and shares it among the laws over this type, so no law
// case meshes a face (testing strategy, part a). Chunk L1's MeshedWitness holds the finished
// outcome; this one holds the inputs of layer 06, which that outcome does not expose.

// A model, its canonical edge discretizations, and one face mesh per model face in face order.
// Invariant: FaceMeshes.Count == Model.Faces.Count and FaceMeshes[f].Face is f.
type AssemblyWitness
{
    Name: String;
    Model: BrepModel;
    Discretizations: EdgeDiscretizations;
    FaceMeshes: Array<FaceMesh>;
}
